1456
00:55:11.440 --> 00:55:14.560
Whereas if they just sat around for a year

1457
00:55:14.560 --> 00:55:17.570
and did not use that opportunity once again.

1458
00:55:17.570 --> 00:55:20.870
I think that's an appropriate kind

1459
00:55:20.870 --> 00:55:22.810
of place to segue into something you were talking

1460
00:55:22.810 --> 00:55:24.350
about in your podcast the other day.

1461
00:55:24.350 --> 00:55:26.350
Which is this idea.

1462
00:55:26.350 --> 00:55:31.340
Well, two ideas first being to think

1463
00:55:31.340 --> 00:55:34.240
about not just working out, but working in.

1464
00:55:34.240 --> 00:55:36.090
Which is kind of what we've already been talking about

1465
00:55:36.090 --> 00:55:40.020
but also this idea of showing up is not enough.

1466
00:55:40.020 --> 00:55:42.380
Like where is the intentionality

1467
00:55:42.380 --> 00:55:43.460
that you're bringing to

1468
00:55:43.460 --> 00:55:44.750
what it is that you're doing.

1469
00:55:44.750 --> 00:55:45.890
And of course this is something

1470
00:55:45.890 --> 00:55:48.260
that's applicable to any athlete

1471
00:55:48.260 --> 00:55:50.720
how they're approaching their training regimen.

1472
00:55:50.720 --> 00:55:53.640
But in life to whatever it is that we're doing.

1473
00:55:53.640 --> 00:55:57.090
Particularly now where everything has been appended

1474
00:55:57.090 --> 00:55:59.360
and it's causing confusion and anxiety.

1475
00:55:59.360 --> 00:56:01.540
And we're all kind of asking ourselves questions

1476
00:56:01.540 --> 00:56:03.720
about like, what, why am I doing this?

1477
00:56:03.720 --> 00:56:05.204
Like we're all being-

1478
00:56:05.204 --> 00:56:06.187
It's evaluated.

1479
00:56:06.187 --> 00:56:08.420
We're all everybody's, re-evaluating

1480
00:56:08.420 --> 00:56:09.850
in their own way right now.

1481
00:56:09.850 --> 00:56:12.747
But that's part of what I go into there.

1482
00:56:12.747 --> 00:56:15.310
And that is once you have your purpose

1483
00:56:15.310 --> 00:56:18.149
and your clarity, you can show up with intention

1484
00:56:18.149 --> 00:56:20.410
because you're not questioning the goals.

1485
00:56:20.410 --> 00:56:21.383
You're not questioning the path.

1486
00:56:21.383 --> 00:56:23.130
Now you can focus all your

1487
00:56:24.090 --> 00:56:26.870
on to executing the next workout.

1488
00:56:26.870 --> 00:56:28.770
The next day at work.

1489
00:56:28.770 --> 00:56:31.560
This project to the best of your ability.

1490
00:56:31.560 --> 00:56:33.360
'Cause you're not wondering, well, why am I

1491
00:56:33.360 --> 00:56:35.407
you don't want to be asking, why am I doing this?

1492
00:56:35.407 --> 00:56:39.640
'Cause that takes everything that you have in that workout

1493
00:56:39.640 --> 00:56:43.310
or in that project or that vacation with your family.

1494
00:56:43.310 --> 00:56:45.670
You show up with intention too.

1495
00:56:45.670 --> 00:56:48.020
If you start wondering, why am I here?

1496
00:56:48.020 --> 00:56:49.394
You're not gonna have a good vacation.

1497
00:56:49.394 --> 00:56:50.830
You're not gonna have a good workout.

1498
00:56:50.830 --> 00:56:54.380
You're not gonna have a good work outcome.

1499
00:56:54.380 --> 00:56:57.060
And so the big thing there is

1500
00:56:57.060 --> 00:57:00.150
once you've have the bigger picture, the purpose.

1501
00:57:00.150 --> 00:57:01.430
And once you have the clarity

1502
00:57:01.430 --> 00:57:04.650
which is what I call the coaching, the path, the manual

1503
00:57:04.650 --> 00:57:09.650
the sort of map, then you can execute the workout properly.

1504
00:57:10.080 --> 00:57:12.570
You can execute your training without wondering

1505
00:57:12.570 --> 00:57:13.470
why am I doing this?

1506
00:57:13.470 --> 00:57:14.720
Well, how is this gonna help me?

1507
00:57:14.720 --> 00:57:17.980
Is this keeping me on my path towards my desired outcome?

1508
00:57:17.980 --> 00:57:21.490
And is this what the coach and I discussed?

1509
00:57:21.490 --> 00:57:23.270
It's all been laid out already.

1510
00:57:23.270 --> 00:57:24.630
And we know that from swimming

1511
00:57:24.630 --> 00:57:27.560
we're just so ingrained in this that we don't have.

1512
00:57:27.560 --> 00:57:30.200
Well, of course these 400 items are helping me swim.

1513
00:57:30.200 --> 00:57:31.500
My 400, I am better.

1514
00:57:31.500 --> 00:57:33.760
Of course, this set of two hundreds

1515
00:57:33.760 --> 00:57:36.270
with the middle hundred fly is helping me swim

1516
00:57:36.270 --> 00:57:37.550
my 400 I am better.

1517
00:57:37.550 --> 00:57:39.770
But in the endurance training world

1518
00:57:39.770 --> 00:57:41.360
or just in the work world,

1519
00:57:41.360 --> 00:57:43.310
if you don't know where you're heading

1520
00:57:43.310 --> 00:57:44.950
and why you're doing it,

1521
00:57:44.950 --> 00:57:49.600
the quality of your work is always going to be limited.

1522
00:57:49.600 --> 00:57:53.320
Because you're just constantly wasting cognitive energy

1523
00:57:53.320 --> 00:57:56.790
cognitive load, as they call it on other things

1524
00:57:56.790 --> 00:57:59.260
in order to make it more intentional and clear for you.

1525
00:57:59.260 --> 00:58:02.060
Once you have that out, you can hit flow.

1526
00:58:02.060 --> 00:58:03.650
You're right in the moment

1527
00:58:03.650 --> 00:58:05.960
because you're not worried about all the other things

1528
00:58:05.960 --> 00:58:07.830
'cause they've been clarified for you.

1529
00:58:07.830 --> 00:58:10.640
That makes me think about some questions I get asked

1530
00:58:10.640 --> 00:58:15.640
from athletes in general, like 13 to 18 year old age range.

1531
00:58:17.070 --> 00:58:20.293
Well, what does it mean to set an intention?

1532
00:58:22.071 --> 00:58:25.069
The concept is very new.

1533
00:58:25.069 --> 00:58:26.692
Most don't know.

1534
00:58:26.692 --> 00:58:28.560
That's not limited to 13 to 18 year olds.

1535
00:58:28.560 --> 00:58:31.653
Most adults that I work with don't know what that means.

1536
00:58:31.653 --> 00:58:35.530
And it's a very, I don't want to say nuance maybe

1537
00:58:35.530 --> 00:58:39.580
but to have the word intention

1538
00:58:39.580 --> 00:58:41.470
I think it's confusing to people.

1539
00:58:41.470 --> 00:58:43.720
'Cause it's like, well, I mean

1540
00:58:43.720 --> 00:58:45.880
I know I want to be here and it's like, well, why.

1541
00:58:45.880 --> 00:58:48.363
You have to kind of dig a few layers deeper.

1542
00:58:49.400 --> 00:58:51.320
But I get asked that question a lot

1543
00:58:51.320 --> 00:58:54.240
and it does make me wonder what would it be

1544
00:58:54.240 --> 00:58:57.483
like to have a buffer on each end of a workout.

1545
00:58:58.470 --> 00:59:01.040
10 minutes before and 10 minutes after.

1546
00:59:01.040 --> 00:59:02.070
To where you come in

1547
00:59:02.070 --> 00:59:05.100
and you literally lay on the floor and breathe.

1548
00:59:05.100 --> 00:59:08.660
And set your intention for the workout, you do the thing.

1549
00:59:08.660 --> 00:59:11.400
And then you get out and you lay back down on the floor

1550
00:59:11.400 --> 00:59:14.312
and you breathe and you set your intention moving forward.

1551
00:59:14.312 --> 00:59:15.703
I think about this all the time.

1552
00:59:15.703 --> 00:59:17.980
You do do an inventory of what just occurred.

1553
00:59:17.980 --> 00:59:19.940
And did you live up to the intention

1554
00:59:19.940 --> 00:59:20.773
that you set for that?

1555
00:59:20.773 --> 00:59:21.606
Exactly.

1556
00:59:21.606 --> 00:59:23.860
And it's intended. It's not perfect.

1557
00:59:23.860 --> 00:59:25.130
It's intended.

1558
00:59:25.130 --> 00:59:30.130
I am coming into this with an intention to do X, Y, Z

1559
00:59:30.250 --> 00:59:32.500
to the best of my current abilities.

1560
00:59:32.500 --> 00:59:34.370
It doesn't mean I have to do it perfectly.

1561
00:59:34.370 --> 00:59:36.500
It doesn't mean I always have to achieve it

1562
00:59:36.500 --> 00:59:41.320
but my focus towards that intention was clear.

1563
00:59:41.320 --> 00:59:44.030
And I did the best to my current abilities.

1564
00:59:44.030 --> 00:59:46.890
Current is very important because we judge ourselves

1565
00:59:46.890 --> 00:59:50.100
on our future person, not who we are in the now.

1566
00:59:50.100 --> 00:59:54.060
And therefore I can finish that look back

1567
00:59:54.060 --> 00:59:55.770
and I get a little dopamine hit.

1568
00:59:55.770 --> 01:00:00.120
Every time I hit an intention successfully my walls today

1569
01:00:00.120 --> 01:00:01.580
I swim butterfly.

1570
01:00:01.580 --> 01:00:03.800
Like we keep coming back to swimming

1571
01:00:03.800 --> 01:00:05.820
'cause it's easy for us to highlight.

1572
01:00:05.820 --> 01:00:09.030
But I swim my butterflies every second breath.

1573
01:00:09.030 --> 01:00:11.270
I didn't do every single breath .

1574
01:00:11.270 --> 01:00:13.460
For the whole workout an easy intention.

