I wanna make sure that my stride is behind me

1577
01:00:18.747 --> 01:00:21.311
and my heels are kicking up high, the entire workout

1578
01:00:21.311 --> 01:00:24.490
regardless of anything else, I wanna make sure

1579
01:00:24.490 --> 01:00:26.900
that I do the rest interval today properly.

1580
01:00:26.900 --> 01:00:28.110
I'm not gonna jog it.

1581
01:00:28.110 --> 01:00:31.100
I'm literally gonna sit down center myself

