01:00:31.100 --> 01:00:34.470
and prepare myself for the next best possible interval.

1583
01:00:34.470 --> 01:00:36.400
All those are little intentions

1584
01:00:36.400 --> 01:00:38.630
on how you get a workout done.

1585
01:00:38.630 --> 01:00:41.380
And then afterwards you go, well, it wasn't necessarily

1586
01:00:41.380 --> 01:00:44.930
that I feel so much different from a physical standpoint

1587
01:00:44.930 --> 01:00:46.800
but my sense of accomplishment

1588
01:00:46.800 --> 01:00:50.400
my sense of execution is so much more powerful.

1589
01:00:50.400 --> 01:00:53.160
And it allows me to move on from that workout.

1590
01:00:53.160 --> 01:00:55.710
In such a better, more positive place.

1591
01:00:55.710 --> 01:00:57.280
I can now focus on work.

1592
01:00:57.280 --> 01:00:58.880
I can now focus on family.

1593
01:00:58.880 --> 01:01:01.070
I can now focus on school.

1594
01:01:01.070 --> 01:01:05.980
Because I checked off all my intentions successfully

1595
01:01:05.980 --> 01:01:07.270
closed that move on.

1596
01:01:07.270 --> 01:01:10.110
And we carry so much with us

1597
01:01:10.110 --> 01:01:11.850
especially as younger athletes.

1598
01:01:11.850 --> 01:01:13.660
And so the next thing like, oh, I probably

1599
01:01:13.660 --> 01:01:15.340
could have done that better.

1600
01:01:15.340 --> 01:01:16.530
But that, like you said

1601
01:01:16.530 --> 01:01:18.940
10 minutes before, 10 minutes after is perfect.

1602
01:01:18.940 --> 01:01:21.200
Because then we can just put that behind us

1603
01:01:21.200 --> 01:01:24.290
driving from the workout back through the back home

1604
01:01:24.290 --> 01:01:27.670
driving from the workout or walking to school.

1605
01:01:27.670 --> 01:01:30.590
And creating that buffer and then going, you know what?

1606
01:01:30.590 --> 01:01:31.423
That was good.

1607
01:01:31.423 --> 01:01:32.790
That was good enough.

1608
01:01:32.790 --> 01:01:36.890
It was good to my expectations, my intentions, I set prior.

1609
01:01:36.890 --> 01:01:39.500
And now I'm gonna do it better this afternoon or tomorrow.

1610
01:01:39.500 --> 01:01:41.710
But for now, I'm gonna set the next intentions

1611
01:01:41.710 --> 01:01:46.170
for school, for work for family.

1612
01:01:46.170 --> 01:01:47.590
But precedent to that of course

1613
01:01:47.590 --> 01:01:49.070
