1618
01:01:58.390 --> 01:01:59.370
And I think where some

1619
01:01:59.370 --> 01:02:02.380
confusion around intentionality comes in

1620
01:02:02.380 --> 01:02:04.650
is that it can be defined

1621
01:02:04.650 --> 01:02:06.720
in a macro context or in a micro.

1622
01:02:06.720 --> 01:02:08.520
Like, yes I'm gonna work on my walls

1623
01:02:08.520 --> 01:02:12.060
and my workout, like a micro intention.

1624
01:02:12.060 --> 01:02:14.610
But the broader intentionality

1625
01:02:14.610 --> 01:02:17.630
I'm gonna express my potential as an athlete.

1626
01:02:17.630 --> 01:02:21.443
That can be an intention, but that becomes very vague.

1627
01:02:22.657 --> 01:02:24.580
I think that speaks more

1628
01:02:24.580 --> 01:02:27.250
to the clarity piece about identity

1629
01:02:27.250 --> 01:02:32.250
and your values and intentionality on the day in day out.

1630
01:02:32.490 --> 01:02:34.873
I'm writing in my journal or I'm doing.

1631
01:02:36.150 --> 01:02:39.200
I'm practicing this mental habit

1632
01:02:39.200 --> 01:02:44.200
of being in the mindset of intention focused

1633
01:02:44.710 --> 01:02:45.970
I think works best

1634
01:02:45.970 --> 01:02:48.300
when you are specific about little things.

1635
01:02:48.300 --> 01:02:49.940
Absolutely.

1636
01:02:49.940 --> 01:02:51.940
And you nailed it, like there's micro

1637
01:02:51.940 --> 01:02:54.530
and macro and it can get confusing.

1638
01:02:54.530 --> 01:02:56.650
When it's like, well my intention.

1639
01:02:56.650 --> 01:02:57.483
I've had athletes-

1640
01:02:57.483 --> 01:02:59.160
I could just be awesome.

1641
01:02:59.160 --> 01:03:00.640
Or like, I wanna go to the Olympics

1642
01:03:00.640 --> 01:03:02.100
but then wait is not a goal.

1643
01:03:02.100 --> 01:03:03.077
Or like, what do you mean by intention?

1644
01:03:03.077 --> 01:03:04.167
And so it is something to clarify.

1645
01:03:04.167 --> 01:03:05.374
Those are good questions.

1646
01:03:05.374 --> 01:03:06.800
They're great questions.

1647
01:03:06.800 --> 01:03:09.460
And I honestly get humbled that they're asking.

1648
01:03:09.460 --> 01:03:11.020
'Cause it's like, oh wow.

1649
01:03:11.020 --> 01:03:14.200
Like I could even explore that a little bit more.

1650
01:03:14.200 --> 01:03:15.990
Maybe I need to understand the difference

1651
01:03:15.990 --> 01:03:17.430
between intention and goal setting

1652
01:03:17.430 --> 01:03:20.740
or understanding micro intentions and macro intentions.

1653
01:03:20.740 --> 01:03:23.730
Because it is, we attach meanings to words too.

1654
01:03:23.730 --> 01:03:25.740
So whatever we attached

1655
01:03:25.740 --> 01:03:28.330
