1658
01:03:35.280 --> 01:03:37.180
And that's their view of what an intention is

1659
01:03:37.180 --> 01:03:40.320
then we have to kind of dissect what that is.

1660
01:03:40.320 --> 01:03:41.710
'Cause they are a swimmer

1661
01:03:41.710 --> 01:03:44.990
and they need to learn it maybe a different way to do that.

1662
01:03:44.990 --> 01:03:46.260
These are just questions I get

1663
01:03:46.260 --> 01:03:47.520
and things that I hear.

1664
01:03:47.520 --> 01:03:48.750
And I think it's very interesting

1665
01:03:48.750 --> 01:03:50.530
