1667
01:03:53.770 --> 01:03:55.650
And their purpose and their reason

1668
01:03:55.650 --> 01:03:57.470
for doing the sport that they're doing

1669
01:03:57.470 --> 01:03:59.484
or competing or performing in whatever they're doing.

1670
01:03:59.484 --> 01:04:03.050
Exactly. Spending so much time on something.

1671
01:04:03.050 --> 01:04:05.400
But I bring it back to a deeper purpose

1672
01:04:05.400 --> 01:04:07.320
and what I call the deeper why.

1673
01:04:07.320 --> 01:04:10.000
If you don't have your deeper, why and many

1674
01:04:11.720 --> 01:04:14.720
all my athletes go through this exercise every year

1675
01:04:14.720 --> 01:04:17.210
