1677
01:04:19.430 --> 01:04:22.450
The cliche is I wanna be a good role model for my kids.

1678
01:04:22.450 --> 01:04:23.283
Well guess what?

1679
01:04:23.283 --> 01:04:24.116
Your kids are not up at 4:00 AM

1680
01:04:24.116 --> 01:04:25.590
