1682
01:04:26.860 --> 01:04:28.210
So they're not seeing you.

1683
01:04:28.210 --> 01:04:29.410
I want to be a good role model.

1684
01:04:29.410 --> 01:04:30.530
I want to be visible.

1685
01:04:30.530 --> 01:04:32.950
Show them how hard I work

1686
01:04:32.950 --> 01:04:33.783
well that doesn't work.

1687
01:04:33.783 --> 01:04:35.420
