1691
01:04:40.850 --> 01:04:42.620
But to me, that's not.

1692
01:04:42.620 --> 01:04:43.690
And I challenge them.

1693
01:04:43.690 --> 01:04:44.550
That's not your deeper why.

1694
01:04:44.550 --> 01:04:47.590
Like when things get difficult

1695
01:04:47.590 --> 01:04:49.890
