1705
01:05:10.920 --> 01:05:12.830
and that validation

1706
01:05:12.830 --> 01:05:16.440
that lack of attention that you got as a child that.

1707
01:05:16.440 --> 01:05:20.030
There's so different things in here I'd want to be visible.

1708
01:05:20.030 --> 01:05:21.860
I wanna be visible.

1709
01:05:21.860 --> 01:05:24.730
when I'm out there training people recognize me.

1710
01:05:24.730 --> 01:05:27.243
Well, good. Now let's start working from there.

1711
01:05:27.243 --> 01:05:29.160
