1803
01:08:50.390 --> 01:08:51.670
We just ran this far.

1804
01:08:51.670 --> 01:08:52.820
We swam this far.

1805
01:08:52.820 --> 01:08:53.950
We biked this far.

1806
01:08:53.950 --> 01:08:55.700
We rock this far.

1807
01:08:55.700 --> 01:08:59.900
But it's still below the surface is still the same issues.

1808
01:08:59.900 --> 01:09:04.420
And eventually you can't avoid it.

1809
01:09:04.420 --> 01:09:07.780
Like you have to turn around and quit facing the sun

