1815
01:09:21.030 --> 01:09:21.929
And unfortunately not

1816
01:09:21.929 --> 01:09:25.460
unfortunately I can't even use that word properly.

1817
01:09:25.460 --> 01:09:27.953
When I had that with Kona,

1818
01:09:29.270 --> 01:09:31.580
it was the validation that I could

1819
01:09:31.580 --> 01:09:33.990
that I was missing so much with swimming and

1820
01:09:33.990 --> 01:09:35.410
