2768
01:48:09.800 --> 01:48:11.327
Cause they're like,

2769
01:48:11.327 --> 01:48:15.007
"He's just too like, oh my gosh, go away."

2770
01:48:16.620 --> 01:48:19.200
Compliance will take you pretty far.

2771
01:48:19.200 --> 01:48:21.450
Like there's the person who can read all the books

2772
01:48:21.450 --> 01:48:24.360
and they get it and they actually apply it in their life.

2773
01:48:24.360 --> 01:48:27.210
And they can become amazing

2774
01:48:27.210 --> 01:48:29.200
