2775
01:48:29.200 --> 01:48:33.010
And it's the person who is the creative thinker.

2776
01:48:33.010 --> 01:48:37.160
Who's pushing the boundaries and like refuses to comply.

2777
01:48:37.160 --> 01:48:40.180
That's the problem athlete or the problem student.

2778
01:48:40.180 --> 01:48:41.930
And when you're a kid and you see that guy

2779
01:48:41.930 --> 01:48:44.410
