2792
01:49:11.900 --> 01:49:13.720
Like I've talked about that with John Moffitt.

2793
01:49:13.720 --> 01:49:15.134
Like he was like that as a swimmer.

2794
01:49:15.134 --> 01:49:16.122
I was the same as John.

2795
01:49:16.122 --> 01:49:16.955
And I was like,

2796
01:49:16.955 --> 01:49:18.600
how come he's not doing what the coach said?

2797
01:49:18.600 --> 01:49:22.240
Or the kid in middle school who was cracking jokes

2798
01:49:22.240 --> 01:49:23.493
and then becomes like,

2799
01:49:24.780 --> 01:49:27.370
Jonah Hill and gets Academy Award nominations.

2800
01:49:27.370 --> 01:49:29.920
It's like he got thrown out tossed out of Boulder,

2801
01:49:29.920 --> 01:49:32.170
like his first year of college.

2802
01:49:32.170 --> 01:49:33.900
But when those people

2803
01:49:33.900 --> 01:49:37.730
