2806
01:49:42.030 --> 01:49:44.180
and there's children that comes out anyway.

2807
01:49:45.680 --> 01:49:47.163
There's not enough narrative.

2808
01:49:48.610 --> 01:49:53.081
Dirt in the way for their more natural self to come out.

2809
01:49:53.081 --> 01:49:54.590
