2861
01:51:47.570 --> 01:51:48.640
You can just blossom.

2862
01:51:48.640 --> 01:51:51.450
But if you just continue to ignore that,

2863
01:51:51.450 --> 01:51:53.167
you're never going to find out.

2864
01:51:53.167 --> 01:51:55.610
You're just going to be bouncing from spot to spot.

2865
01:51:55.610 --> 01:51:58.305
And that's the classic like, well,

2866
01:51:58.305 --> 01:51:59.550
what am I destined to do?

2867
01:51:59.550 --> 01:52:02.530
Or what is my path?

2868
01:52:02.530 --> 01:52:04.230
Even in that question.

2869
01:52:04.230 --> 01:52:05.920
Well you got to sort of get dirty

2870
01:52:05.920 --> 01:52:07.360
and keep doing a variety

2871
01:52:07.360 --> 01:52:09.950
of things to find that where that sweet spot is.

2872
01:52:09.950 --> 01:52:13.310
And that's those first years from college

2873
01:52:13.310 --> 01:52:15.480
until like your mid thirties.

2874
01:52:15.480 --> 01:52:18.150
Well you just got to sort of, it's messy.

2875
01:52:18.150 --> 01:52:19.700
It's meant to be messy.

2876
01:52:19.700 --> 01:52:22.700
And I think we should disabuse people of this idea

2877
01:52:22.700 --> 01:52:24.810
that you're supposed to just have it figured out.

2878
01:52:24.810 --> 01:52:26.233
No.

2879
01:52:26.233 --> 01:52:27.750
You're never going to.

2880
01:52:27.750 --> 01:52:29.150
And you're allowed to change

2881
